<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
	<!-- Tauri merges this file into the bundle's Info.plist. -->
	<!-- NSLocalNetworkUsageDescription: why this key, see docs/host-ssh.md 5.6 -->
	<key>NSLocalNetworkUsageDescription</key>
	<string>把这台电脑借给智能体后，它们运行的命令要用这项权限访问你局域网里的设备（如路由器、NAS）。When you lend this Mac to agents, the commands they run use this to reach devices on your local network, such as a router or NAS.</string>
	<!-- NSAppTransportSecurity: remote tabs open the remote host's localhost as remote.localhost
	     (ALIAS_HOST in src-tauri/src/browser/remote.rs), a dotted host name over plain HTTP; without this key
	     ATS blocks it in the packaged app (NSURLErrorDomain -1022). The built-in browser must also
	     open plain-HTTP pages. This key only covers web content (WKWebView), not the app's own requests. -->
	<key>NSAppTransportSecurity</key>
	<dict>
		<key>NSAllowsArbitraryLoadsInWebContent</key>
		<true/>
	</dict>
</dict>
</plist>
